nt: for (a), a totally isotropic subspace satisfies both\ninequalities of <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"cor-inertia-subspace-characterization\">@cor-inertia-subspace-characterization</span>\n(b). For (b), pair up a positive eigenvector with a negative\none.</em></p>","file":"ch17-variational/10-inertia-revisited.html"}